 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Requests select a site with `X-Larder-Site` (case insensitive header name);
+without the header the site is `main`. An unknown site returns HTTP 400
+with code `unknown_site`. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
+Batches (including waste and order receipt locations), stock on hand, cooking,
+alerts, stock value and stock-takes are restricted to the selected site.
+Cross-site batch ids return `unknown_batch`; cross-site stock-take ids
+return `not_found`; cross-site locations return `unknown_location`.
