+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` contains site records with string `id` and `name`. Every location
+  has a `site` referring to one of these ids. Batches and stock-takes belong
+  to a site through their location; ids and ledger sequences remain global.
+- Schema 1 and 2 files migrate to schema 3 with a `main` site and all existing
+  locations assigned to it. The seed also includes the Annex kitchen.
+- Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared. Stock quantities, batches,
+  cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use the active site.
